1 - 2026-07-23 15:47:06 --> Sum opening QTY across ALL MCs for each itm_id_unit_id  <br>SELECT "itm_id_unit_id", COALESCE(SUM(itm_op_bal_qty), 0) AS qty_sum
FROM "itmoppybal"
